est elevation Inspect and make safe both Northwest and Southwest elevations.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  STAFF UPDATES\n\n\n\n\n\n  PROJECTED ADJOURNMENT: 7:00 PM \n\n\n\n", "files": [{"file_label": "Official Filed Posting", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/8-13-26_FPCLDC%20Agenda_v1.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "3a4ac0818f37f7a13813010a1c040b8144357754c8bc43fcb9acc746f7f75836"}], "status": "ok", "checked_at": "2026-08-04T18:17:55.092943+00:00"}
