{"notice_id": "16601796", "title": "Boston Fair Housing Commission Meeting | Boston.gov", "cancelled": false, "public_testimony": false, "notice_url": "https://www.boston.gov/public-notices/16601796", "posted_at": "2026-07-24T11:19:00-04:00", "event_datetime": "2026-07-28T18:00:00Z", "address_1": "VIRTUALLY ", "address_2": "", "page_text": "\n\n\n\n\n  AGENDA \n\n\n\nDear Public Records Department,\nThe Boston Fair Housing Commission  will be meeting virtually via Zoom on\nTuesday , July 28, 2026 at 2:00 PM for the monthly Commissioners Meeting.\nPlease post notice of the upcoming Boston Fair Housing Commission meeting\nscheduled as follows:\nDate: July 28, 2026\nTime: 2:00 AM – 4:00 AM\nLocation: Virtual (details below)\nMeeting Link:Join Virtual Meeting\nGoogle Meet joining info\nVideo call link: https://meet.google.com/vxc-drkv-gki\nOr dial: (US) +1 260-300-0217 PIN: 318 001 825#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/tpz-qxrf-dmw?pin=8373487611522\nThe meeting will discuss agenda items pertinent to fair housing matters within the\nCity of Boston. Please confirm receipt and posting.\nThank you for your assistance.\nThe Boston Fair Housing Commission is physically located at One City Hall Square,\nRoom 966, Boston, MA 02201.\nPursuant to Massachusetts General Law c. 39 §23B, please post notice of this meeting.\nThank you.\nSincerely Yours,\nDwayne S. Watts\nClerk of the Commission\nOnline Video/Phone Conference: Meeting Access information provided upon request\n1. Meeting Called to Order / Opening Remarks\n2. Commission Hearing - 2025-BFHC-037 VICTORIA PARHAM\n3. Closing Remarks and Meeting Adjournment\n \n\n\n\n\n", "files": [{"file_label": "OFFICIAL FILED AGENDA", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/July%2028%20Victoria%20Parham%20BFHC%20Commissioners%20Meeting%20Agenda.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "c6b1e0b0d58018a1f000a700bd89e69476d262c2743616c83c73917a3198c3a6"}, {"file_label": "OFFICIAL FILED POSTING", "file_ur