{"notice_id": "16600696", "title": "City Council Committee on Rules, Ethics, and Administration Hearing on Docket #0475 | Boston.gov", "cancelled": false, "public_testimony": true, "notice_url": "https://www.boston.gov/public-notices/16600696", "posted_at": "2026-07-16T10:42:00-04:00", "event_datetime": "2026-08-13T14:00:00Z", "address_1": "Iannella Chamber, Fifth Floor", "address_2": "Boston City Hall", "page_text": "\n\n\n\n\n  Docket #0475\n\n\n\nOrder for a hearing to review the application and intent of Rule 15.\nThis matter was sponsored by Councilor Erin J. Murphy, and was referred to the Committee on March 4, 2026.\nNOTICE: The Boston City Council may have a quorum in attendance due to standing committees of the City Council consisting of both voting and non-voting members. However, members attending this duly posted meeting are participating and deliberating only in conjunction with the business of the standing committee.\nPublic Testimony \nMembers of the public are cordially invited to attend and testify in person or virtually. Those wishing to testify in person should arrive five (5) minutes before the call of the hearing to sign up. Please bring fifteen (15) copies of any written documentation you wish to present at the hearing. Those wishing to testify virtually via videoconference should email the staff contact for a link and instructions to do so. Written comments may be sent to the Committee or staff email (below) and will be made a part of the record and available to all Councilors. The public may watch this hearing via live stream at www.boston.gov/city-council-tv and on Xfinity 8/RCN 82/Fios 964. This hearing will be recorded.\nStaff Contact: Michelle A Goldberg\nMail Address:  Docket #0475 City Council, City Hall, 5th Floor, Boston, MA 02201\nCommittee Email:  ccc.ra@boston.gov  \nStaff Email:  michelle.a.goldberg@boston.gov | Staff Telephone:  (617) 635-3040\nBroadcast Live on Xfinity 8/RCN 82/ Fios 964 and streamed at: boston.gov/city-council-tv\n\n\n\n\n", "files": [{"file_label": "Docket #0475", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/Hearing%20Order%20Review%20of%20Rule%2015%202026.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "92aabfa1d0c892cf121ca97d503b158b379cf8db1a7645c3eef94ccdadfcff98"}, {"file_label": "Notice of Accommodations", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/MG%20COPY_Notice%20of%20Accommodations%20-%20LCA.docx.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "b50cd31b47ada6b99e1efa51cc15668d9eb9bdbe8e6ea3e75fc11c425fbed2fd"}, {"file_label": "Official Filed Posting", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/0475%20%28In%20Person%29%20Hearing%208.13.26.docx.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "37a5dba0b9b66f3b015045daf7ebedea4c87870664112b39557d639a2e2213fc"}], "status": "ok", "checked_at": "2026-08-07T18:52:00.040550+00:00"}
