{"notice_id": "16602406", "title": "Fort Point Channel Landmark District Commission | Boston.gov", "cancelled": false, "public_testimony": true, "notice_url": "https://www.boston.gov/public-notices/16602406", "posted_at": "2026-07-30T11:45:00-04:00", "event_datetime": "2026-08-13T22:00:00Z", "address_1": "ZOOM", "address_2": "https://www.zoomgov.com/j/1654472127", "page_text": "\n\n\n\n\n  RATIFICATION OF 7/9/26 PUBLIC HEARING MINUTES\n\n\n\n\n\n  DESIGN REVIEW HEARING\n\n\n\nAPP # 27.0065 FPC 324 A STREET\nApplicant: James Cochener\nProposed Work: Remove existing awnings, patch and repair brickwork. Remove existing light sconces, patch and repair. Remove existing railing and sculpture. At roof remove existing steel structure and weathervane. Install new illuminated channel letter sign at roof. Install new painted sign, two lightbox signs, and 3 new awnings. Additionally, install new planter boxes at street level and at the underside of windows. Clean and repaint masonry to like new condition, install new light sconces, and paint doors. \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  ADMINISTRATIVE REVIEW/APPROVAL\n\n\n\nAPP # 27.0057 FPC  10-30 CHANNEL CENTER STREET:  At all elevations: spot pointing open masonry joints, misc. brick replacement on first floor. New brick to match existing. On North and South elevations: repair cracks, remove brick wythe to inspect, clean, and coat structural steel if applicable, reinstall brick wythe, clean, point open stone joints and repair cracks on all stone elements (East and West elevations). Inspect/repair/replace steel lintels as needed on the first floor (East and West Elevations). \nAPP # 27.0073 FPC  343 CONGRESS STREET:  Limited Façade Repairs – To match existing: Cut/point specified areas on the Northwest elevation, Cut/point bottom 3’ of brick as needed on the Southwest elevation. Replace spalled brick (Allowance of 25 on each elevation). Clean and coat cast iron shutter hinges and install a soft joint at the metal-to-brick interface on the Northwest elevation Inspect and make safe both Northwest and Southwest elevations.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  STAFF UPDATES\n\n\n\n\n\n  PROJECTED ADJOURNMENT: 7:00 PM \n\n\n\n", "files": [{"file_label": "Official Filed Posting", "file_url": "https://www.boston.gov/sites/default/files/file/2026/07/8-13-26_FPCLDC%20Agenda_v1.pdf", "download_success": true, "file_hash": "3a4ac0818f37f7a13813010a1c040b8144357754c8bc43fcb9acc746f7f75836"}], "status": "ok", "checked_at": "2026-08-08T01:32:00.561110+00:00"}
