{"notice_id": "16600116", "title": "Licensing Board Virtual Voting Agenda | Boston.gov", "cancelled": false, "public_testimony": false, "notice_url": "https://www.boston.gov/public-notices/16600116", "posted_at": "2026-07-14T07:22:00-04:00", "event_datetime": "2026-07-16T14:00:00Z", "address_1": "1 City Hall Sq", "address_2": "VIRTUAL", "page_text": "\n\n\n\n\n  VIRTUAL Voting Agenda\n\n\n\nLicensed Premise Inspection Hearing on Tuesday, July 14 , 2026\n1. Boston Ballroom Corporation\nDoing business as: Royale\nLocation: 279 Tremont St Boston, MA 02116\nLicense#: LB-99277, Notice/Violation#: 054991\n5/22/26, Category: CV7AL\nDate: 01/01/2026\nNotice: Assault and battery employee on patron in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 13A.\n2. Trinity Stuart Concessions LLC \nDoing business as: The Raffles Hotel\nLocation: 40 Trinity Pl Boston, MA 02116\nLicense#: LB-485388, Notice/Violation#: 070288, Category: INNAL\nDate: 05/01/2026\nNotice: Person in charge failure to notify police of an assault and battery (patron on patron) in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64 and Board's rule 1.14B.\nOver occupancy on lower level in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64 and Board's rule 1.03J, 1.06 A., F.\nCertificate of Inspection expired in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64 and Board's rule 1.02B.\n3. Dorset Restaurant Group LLC \nDoing business as: Landmark Public House\nLocation: 772 Adams St Dorchester, MA 02122\nLicense#: LB-157964, Notice/Violation#: 010139, Category: CV7ALN\nDate: 04/19/2026\nNotice: Assault and battery patron on employee in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 13A.\nAssault and battery employee on patron in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 13A.\n4. Croke Park, Inc.\nDoing business as: Croke Park\nLocation: 268 W Broadway South Boston, MA 02127\nLicense#: LB-99299, Notice/Violation#: 010737, Category: CV7AL\nDate: 05/09/2026\nNotice: Assault and battery patron on employee in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 13A.\nAssault and battery patron on patron in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 13A.\nFailure to cooperate with police investigation in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64 and Board's rule 1.10 A+B.\n5. Croke Park, Inc. \nDoing business as: Croke Park\nLocation: 268 W Broadway South Boston, MA 02127\nLicense#: LB-99299, Notice/Violation#: 055000, Category: CV7AL\nDate: 05/31/2026\nNotice: Assault and battery dangerous weapon (knife) patron on patron in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64, ch. 265 s. 15A.\n6. Wendy's Of New England, LLC \nDoing business as: Wendy's\nLocation: 71 - 77 Summer St Boston, MA 02111\nLicense#: LB-100297, Notice/Violation#: 054989\n5/22/26, Category: CVICT\nDate: 05/12/2026\nNotice: Assault and battery dangerous weapon (knife) in violation of M.G.L. ch. 140 s. 9.\nAssault and battery patron on patron in violation of M.G.L. ch. 140 s. 9.\nNo posted Common Victualler license in violation of M.G.L. ch. 140 s. 9.\n7. K & G Entertainment LLC \nDoing business as: Sidebar\nLocation: 14 - 16 Bromfield St Boston, MA 02108\nLicense#: LB-99416, Notice/Violation#: 054995, Category: CV7AL\nDate: 05/28/2026\nNotice: Patron/Dj drugs (marijuana) in front of premise in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64.\nService of more than 2 drinks of alcohol to one patron at a time in violation of M.G.L. ch. 138 s. 64\nTransactional Hearing on Wednesday, July 15, 2026\n1. Blank Street Boston MA LLC\nDoing business as: Blank Street \n250 W Newton St, Boston, MA 02115\nLicense #:  LB-630108\nHas applied for a Common Victualler License to be exercised on the above - 2,191SF First-floor and basement space located at 250 West Newton Street, Boston, MA 02115 (formerly known as 100 St. Botolph Street, Boston, MA 02115). The first floor includes a customer takeout counter, seating for (12) patrons, one restroom located along the side of the premises, and a rear back-of-house (BOH) food preparation and service area. The basement is used for storage and employee training purposes. The